sentences.text:
Senior Civil Judge and Member, MACT-XV, Vijayapura in MVC.No.1616/2016 dated 11.08.2021 is modified;
a) Claimant is entitled enhanced compensation of Rs.20,000/- with interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition till its realization.
iii. Amount of compensation enhanced is meagre.

